## 🔄 State Management Visuals

### Button States
```
Default: Primary color + subtle shadow
Hover: Slight elevation increase (2dp → 4dp)
Pressed: Color darkens 10%, scale 0.98
Disabled: 50% opacity, remove shadow
Loading: Rotation animation, progress indicator
```

### Card States
```
Default: Base elevation + outline
