## 🌐 Localization Considerations

### Text Expansion Buffer
- English: 1x buffer
- Hindi (हिन्दी): 1.3x buffer (longer text)
- Kannada (ಕನ್ನಡ): 1.2x buffer
- Adjust button/card sizes accordingly

### Icon Universality
- All icons should be culture-neutral
- Use standard symbols (⚙️ for settings, ♥️ for health)
- Currency icon should represent Indian Rupee (₹)

