## 📥 Implementation Guide

### Adding Assets to Project

```kotlin
// res/drawable/ (PNG files)
// For 6x density scaling:
// - xxhdpi (3x): 1536×1024px base asset
// - xhdpi (2x): 1024×683px
// - hdpi (1.5x): 768×512px
// - mdpi (1x): 512×341px

// Usage in Compose
Image(
    painter = painterResource(id = R.drawable.btn_tap_serve),
    contentDescription = "Tap to serve button",
    modifier = Modifier
        .size(96.dp)
        .clip(CircleShape)
)
```

### Applying Color Theme

```kotlin
// Theme composition
CompositionLocalProvider(
    LocalContentColor provides GreenPrimary,
    LocalRippleConfiguration provides RippleConfiguration(
        color = GreenPrimary.copy(alpha = 0.08f)
    )
) {
    StreetTycoonApp()
}
```

### Animation Implementation

```kotlin
// Tap button animation
val scale = remember { Animatable(1f) }
LaunchedEffect(isTapped) {
    if (isTapped) {
        scale.animateTo(0.95f, animationSpec = tween(50))
        scale.animateTo(1f, animationSpec = spring())
    }
}
```

